# No Assumption

## 🚫 NEVER

- Assume files/methods/fields exist
- Assume data structures/types/formats
- Assume business logic/processes/rules
- Guess by experience (unverified)

## ✅ MUST

- Actually verify (Read, Grep, DESCRIBE)
- Decide based on evidence
- Ask when uncertain

**Core Mantra: Verify first, execute later.**
